WEBVTT

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:30.059
That sort of suggests uncertainty.

00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:32.393
So I would say it's a lady,

00:04:32.417 --> 00:04:35.809
age-wise it's a little difficult to tell
from this minimal handwriting,

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:39.601
but I would expect maybe 30s,
maybe 40s, but let's find out.

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:41.724
It says -- and a question
about the future --

00:04:41.738 --> 00:04:45.184
it says, "JN, center."

00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:48.143
So it's going to be somebody
in this big central section here.

00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:50.226
If you think this is you,
if you wrote one,

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.518
could you make a fuss?

00:04:51.542 --> 00:04:53.851
It's a bit difficult for me
to see in the center.

00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:55.143
Hi, give us a wave.

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:56.476
So J ...

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.018
Jane? Jessica?

00:04:58.042 --> 00:04:59.309
Jessica: Yes.

00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:01.308
Derren Brown: Which one?
Jessica: Jessica.